# Design sequences - PUBLISHED as of 2026-11-03.
#
# These were withheld while each submission window was open. All four windows are
# now closed (EGFR, TNF-alpha, GLP-1R submitted; TfR1 closed 1 Nov unsubmitted), so
# the sequences are published with the write-ups that cite them.
#
# Kept for the record, because the withholding rule was twice written too narrowly:
# it first named each file individually, so a new round2_sequences.csv was not
# covered and got committed; then "submission/challenge2_*" named one challenge, so
# the first challenge 3 file was not covered either. Any future withholding rule
# must match by pattern, not by name.
#
# Challenge 5 (KRAS G12D pMHC) is open until 8 Nov. Its sequences go here, ignored,
# until that window closes:
pmhc/results/*sequences*.csv
submission/challenge5_*

